    <activity xml:id="subspace-dimension">
<statement>
  <p> For each vector space below, calculate the dimension.  </p>
    <ol marker="(a)">
      <li>
        <p>
          <m>\mathbb{R}^{n}</m>
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <m>\mathbb{P}_{5}</m>
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <m>M_{3 \times 3}(\mathbb{R})</m>, the vector space of <m>3 \times 3</m> matrics with real entries.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <m>{\cal{L}}_{3}(\mathbb{R})</m>, the subspace of lower triangular <m>3 \times 3</m> matrices.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <m>C(0,1)</m>, the vector space of continuous real-valued functions on <m>(0,1)</m>.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <m>c_{0}</m>, the subspace of real-valued sequences that converge to 0. 
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          The subspace <m>W ={\textrm{span}}\ \left\{ 1, x, x+1, x+2, x^{2}, x^{2}+x \right\}</m>.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          The subspace of constant real-valued sequences.  
        </p>
      </li>
